# Fixture artifacts that are large but reproducible; commit the JSON
# fixtures (the parity contract) but NOT the multi-MB raw HTML copies —
# those can be re-derived via `npm run fixtures:freeze` from the oracle
# repo on this machine. Same for the test-cases archive.
.fixtures/by-filing/**/source.html
.fixtures/test-cases/test_*.py
.codex/
.vercel
